= The Library

Herein contains relevant information about the government and politics of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#008C45">Kingdom</span> <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CFCFCF">of</span> <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CD212A">Italy</span>.

@menu

- @government: <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#008C45">It</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CFCFCF">a</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CD212A">ly</span>'s system of government
- @italy_timeline: Timeline of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#008C45">Kingdom</span> <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CFCFCF">of</span> <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CD212A">Italy</span> before 1919
